        <mxCell id="uo-UxpN2G6u6p_oJiuZl-38" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Verifying the DAG&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Verifying the Dag is as simple as going through each&amp;nbsp; node and check that:&lt;br&gt;1. The hash is correct&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;2. His Parents exist in the Dag&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This can be done linearly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=1;strokeColor=default;spacing=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1320" y="1130" width="371" height="250" as="geometry" />
