        <mxCell id="uo-UxpN2G6u6p_oJiuZl-42" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Merging 2 DAGs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;To merge DAG Y into DAG X you need to add the nodes&amp;nbsp; in Y that are not in X to X.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Furthermore, the graph should be fully verified.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=1;strokeColor=default;spacing=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
