        <mxCell id="svMoqzFHZ02drXgd6kxN-1" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Linearizing the DAG&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A linearization of the graph is the same as a topological sort, as such, this is done using Khan&#39;s algorithm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=1;strokeColor=default;spacing=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
