        <mxCell id="aDYkH86SO8wR03iJJXfE-4" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;How does caching work for each operation?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Cache behaves the same for all network participants, Client or Replica,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;As a Replica, when i cache a certain node for a certain Client/Replica this effectively means that i know that that Client/Replica has knowledge of that Node&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
